      propertyPath: items.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7368075324813034071, guid: d4cd43f4ae70a5e4689289a7913ae5b2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7368075324813034071, guid: d4cd43f4ae70a5e4689289a7913ae5b2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[0]'
      value: "Oh\u2026 salut LINKEDIN. T\u2019es entr\xE9 sans frapper mais tranquille,
        j\u2019suis pos\xE9."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7368075324813034071, guid: d4cd43f4ae70a5e4689289a7913ae5b2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[1]'
      value: "J\u2019bouge pas d\u2019ici moi. Le monde peut br\xFBler, Zelda peut
        crier, les monstres peuvent danser la macarena dehors\u2026 moi j\u2019suis
        bien l\xE0."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7368075324813034071, guid: d4cd43f4ae70a5e4689289a7913ae5b2,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.Array.data[2]'
      value: "Bref, fais ta vie fr\xE9rot. Si tu veux une qu\xEAte\u2026 bah j\u2019en
        ai pas. J\u2019suis trop pos\xE9 pour \xE7a."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7368075324813034071, guid: d4cd43f4ae70a5e4689289a7913ae5b2,
